Current Strengths
- Solid full-stack architecture (Django + React + PostgreSQL + Redis)
- JWT + Google OAuth authentication
- Celery automation for anime data sync
- Clean component architecture with TanStack Query
- Good security practices (rate limiting, XSS prevention)
Top Improvements to Level Up
1. Real Recommendation Engine (Critical Gap) ✅
Current "Recommended for You" just reverses trending. Implement:
- Collaborative filtering based on user ratings
- Content-based similarity using genres/studios ✅
- Hybrid ML approach
2. Import/Export (User Acquisition Blocker)
- MyAnimeList/AniList import for easy migration
- User data export for privacy
3. Social Features (Engagement)
- User following/followers
- Comments on reviews
- Activity feed ("What friends are watching")
- Discussion forums
4. Notifications System
- New episode alerts
- Review reply notifications
- Weekly digest emails
- Push notifications
5. Enhanced Discovery
- Mood-based filtering ("happy", "action-packed")
- Time-based ("30 min episodes")
- Advanced search with Elasticsearch
- Fuzzy matching for typos
6. Gamification (Fun Factor)
- Achievement badges
- Watch streaks
- Review leaderboards
- Themed marathon challenges
7. Mobile Experience
- PWA with offline support
- Touch-optimized gestures
- React Native app
8. Technical Debt
- Zero frontend tests - Add Vitest/Jest + React Testing Library
- No TypeScript - Gradual migration for type safety
- No monitoring - Add Sentry + analytics
- Image optimization - WebP conversion, lazy loading
9. API Documentation
- Add drf-spectacular for OpenAPI/Swagger docs
10. Monetization Ready
- Premium tier (advanced stats, custom themes)
- Streaming service affiliate links